{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15544","headline":"禁中春松 · 周存","name":"禁中春松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几岁含贞节，青青紫禁中。\n日华留偃盖，雉尾转春风。\n不爲繁霜改，那将衆木同。\n千条攒翠色，百尺澹晴空。\n影密金茎近，花明凤沼通。\n安知幽涧侧，独与散樗丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周存","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《御选唐诗》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/御選唐詩_(四庫全書本)）"}